                                "sense_id": "726a3ea5-5fcb-34a4-bf9c-f8396e1a2db5",
                                "text": "intemperate zeal"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "96f62460-6b9e-4ade-88b0-328737d488f5",
                                "sense_id": "726a3ea5-5fcb-34a4-bf9c-f8396e1a2db5",
                                "text": "Constantine engaged himself, by a solemn promise, to deliver Italy from the Goths; advanced as far as the banks of the Po; and after alarming, rather than assisting, his pusillanimous ally, hastily returned to the palace of Arles, to celebrate, with intemperate luxury, his vain and ostentatious triumph."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
